you yield, inconsistent enough to create risk, and manual enough that every volume spike feels like a crisis."}]]]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"py-20 bg-gray-50","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl text-navy-900 mb-6","children":["PROCESSES: ","BANKING & LENDING"," OPERATIONS"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"bg-gold-600 h-1 w-24 mb-12"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6","children":[["$","div","0",{"className":"bg-white border-2 border-gray-200 p-8 hover:border-gold-600 transition-colors","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-xl text-navy-900 font-bold mb-3","children":"Loan Application Intake"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":"Receiving and logging new loan applications across channels — broker, direct, digital, correspondent. Capturing borrower data, property information, and initial documentation. The process that determines whether the rest of the pipeline starts clean or starts behind."}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"bg-white border-2 border-gray-200 p-8 hover:border-gold-600 transition-colors","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-xl text-navy-900 font-bold mb-3","children":"Document Collection & Verification"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":"Gathering required documentation — income, assets, identity, property — and validating completeness, accuracy, and authenticity. The process most lenders do twice because the first pass wasn’t structured to catch what matters."}]]}],["$","div","2",{"className":"bg-white border-2 border-gray-200 p-8 hover:border-gold-600 transition-colors","children":["$L2","$L3"]}],"$L4","$L5","$L6","$L7","$L8","$L9","$La","$Lb","$Lc","$Ld","$Le","$Lf","$L10"]}]]}]}],"$L11","$L12","$L13"]}],null,"$L14"]}],"isPartial":false,"staleTime":300,"varyParams":null,"buildId